ENHANCED_TRACER_PER_CUBIN_TIMEOUT_S = 30 - Per-subprocess deadline (seconds) for the cuobjdump/nvdisasm shell-outs inside enhanced_tracer. On timeout the child process group is SIGTERM'd then SIGKILL'd; the parent always returns normally. Set to 0 to wait indefinitely (legacy behavior).
ENHANCED_TRACER_MAX_PARSER_INPUT_KB = 64 - Maximum size (KB) of the .sass / .rfu files passed to parse_sass / parse_rfu. Cubins whose generated parser inputs exceed the threshold (or whose subprocess timed out) are skipped with a typed enhanced_tracer_cubin_parse_timeout diagnostic. Set to 0 to disable the size pre-skip.
     TOOL_TRACE_CORE = 0 - write the core id in the traces
TERMINATE_UPON_LIMIT = 0 - Stop the process once the current kernel > DYNAMIC_KERNEL_LIMIT_END
USER_DEFINED_FOLDERS = 0 - Uses the user defined folder TRACES_FOLDER path environment
THRESHOLD_UNIQUE_KERNEL_CHECKING = 10 - Number of instructions used to check if kernels with the same name are different
    GATHER_REGISTERS = 0 - Enable gathering of GPU register values. Not available in this version.
